    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d292">

                <pb facs="0314" n="224" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav02/pg224"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/2143b</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Consul at Vladivostok</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Caldwell</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-06-25T17:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 25, 1918,
                                5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Please report full statement: <list>
                        <label>(1)</label>
                        <item>As to total number of Czecho-Slovak troops now at Vladivostok;</item>
                        <label>(2)</label>
                        <item>Number armed with rifles;</item>
                        <label>(3)</label>
                        <item>Character and quantity of other arms including machine guns,
                            etc.;</item>
                        <label>(4)</label>
                        <item>Amount of ammunition they now have;</item>
                        <label>(5)</label>
                        <item>Are additional stores of ammunition available—if so where?</item>
                        <label>(6)</label>
                        <item>Morale of troops;</item>
                        <label>(7)</label>
                        <item>Character and number of higher officers;</item>
                        <label>(8)</label>
                        <item>Outline of military organization.</item>
                    </list></p>
                <p>Answer urgent soon as possible. Questions are to indicate general scope of
                    inquiry, but reply need not be too precise.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Lansing</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
